of anisotropic flow.

\[E\frac{d^{3}N}{dp^{3}}=\frac{1}{2\pi}\frac{d^{2}N}{p_{T}dp_{t}dy}(1+\sum_{n=1}^{ \infty}2v_{n}\cos(n(\phi-\psi_{RP}))+\sum_{n=1}^{\infty}2a_{n}\sin(n(\phi-\Psi_ {RP}))) \tag{1.4}\]

