RICH (Ring Imaging CHerenkov detector), CTB (Central Trigger Barrel), FTPC (Forward TPC), SVT (Silicon Vertex Tracker), and PMD (Photon Multiplicity Detector) are among the few detectors that have been employed in the past. Indian group was responsible for the fabrication and maintenance of the Photon Multiplicity Detector (PMD). The PMD was a pre-shower gas detector that

