contribution associated with the CME and the flow-dependent correlations. By examining and separating these components, researchers can better understand and distinguish the different contributions to the observed correlations.

\[\begin{split}\gamma_{\alpha\beta}=kv_{2}F_{\alpha\beta}-H_{\alpha \beta},\\ \delta_{\alpha\beta}=F_{\alpha\beta}+H_{\alpha\beta},\end{split} \tag{3.7}\]

